# This repository tracks the reusable VoxelBridge Unity editor tool.
# Scenes, imported packages, generated data, design references, and Unity caches
# belong to the local laboratory and are deliberately excluded.
*

# Repository metadata and documentation.
!/.gitignore
!/.gitattributes
!/README.md

# Portable Unity package content, including every required .meta file.
!/Assets/
/Assets/*
!/Assets/VoxelBridge.meta
!/Assets/VoxelBridge/
!/Assets/VoxelBridge/**

# Local visual experiments; keep the reusable prototype shader and tests above.
/Assets/VoxelBridge/Prototypes/
/Assets/VoxelBridge/Prototypes.meta

# World-design notes and archived prototypes remain local and out of this tool repository.
/Docs/
/Archives/
/ProjectSettings/
